{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Aquarium is a fish-raising game that accompanies you in work and study. You can buy cute little fish, collect and feed them. Adult fish will drop stars every minute. Stars can be used to buy various other fish, or you can buy capsules to get rare species. When you are working, relaxing and entertaining, cute little fish swim around on your desktop, which is relaxing and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705Feed the fish and make it grow! Click on the fish to pop out cute bubbles! You can also click and drag the fish to make it swim anywhere on the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/\u5582\u98df.gif?t=1749520099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705Unlock dozens of cute little fish. Different little fish can also trigger bonds, gain buffs, and get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/\u5c0f\u9c7c.jpg?t=1749520099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705A variety of decorations and activities! Purchase and deploy decorations, hold various unique activities, and improve the mood of fish! Fish with improved mood can get more benefits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/\u6d3b\u52a8.jpg?t=1749520099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705You can freely set the fish's activity range on the screen! When working, lower the setting and the fish will only swim at the bottom! When relaxing, raise the setting and the fish can swim freely across the entire screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703090/extras/\u8bbe\u7f6e.jpg?t=1749520099\" /